  "title": "Student Performance Regression & Early-Warning AI",
  "lead": "Trained on 23,985 verified students from the Open University Learning Analytics Dataset. Leverages student demographics, course enrollment, VLE clickstream behavioral analytics, and early assessment scores from the first 60 days to predict the final course score (0\u2013100).",
  "target_label": "Predicted Final Course Score",
  "about_data": "Open University Learning Analytics Dataset (OULAD): 26,361 student-module enrollments across 23,985 unique students, 22 module presentations, and over 10.6 million online learning platform interactions.",
